      "host": "en.wikipedia.org",
      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kokkachal",
      "paragraphs": [
       "<b>Kokkachal</b> (കൊക്കച്ചാൽ, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:IPA/Malayalam\">&#91;ko̞kːɐt͡ʃːaːl&#93;</a>; also spelled <b>Kokkechal</b>) is a small locality and settlement situated in the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kasaragod_district\">Kasaragod district</a> in the Indian state of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kerala\">Kerala</a>. It falls under the administration of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manjeshwaram_taluk\">Manjeshwaram taluk</a> near the northern border of the state."
      ],
      "more": []
     }
